{
  // Big Wave Beach, Melemele Island (plan 23, the rest of the islands): drawn by hand, our words. A wide beach on the open
  // sea west of Route 1's woods, where Alola's surfers ride the swell; a Team Skull grunt has come to spoil it. Ultra Sun
  // and Ultra Moon's Mantine Surf is ours here: the surfer registers Mantine in the Ride Pager (FLAG_ALOLA_RIDE_MANTINE) and
  // sets a course of four gates of buoys on the swell, ridden in order on its back (VAR_ALOLA_MANTINE 1 to 4)
